  "listingUrl": "https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/32083915?check_in=2023-12-20&check_out=2023-12-27&adults=2&children=2&infants=0&pets=0",
  "details": [
    {
      "id": "POLICIES_DEFAULT",
      "title": "Things to know",
      "houseRulesSections": "Checking in and out: Check-in after 4:00 PM, Checkout before 10:00 AM, Self check-in with smart lock, During your stay: 5 guests maximum, No pets, Quiet hours, No parties or events, No smoking, Additional rules, Before you leave: Additional requests"
    },
    {
      "id": "LOCATION_DEFAULT",
      "lat": 32.78359,
      "lng": -117.05815,
      "subtitle": "San Diego, California, United States",
      "title": "Where you’ll be"
    },
    {
      "id": "HIGHLIGHTS_DEFAULT",
      "highlights": "Top 5% of homes, Perfect ratings from families, Fun and games for kids"
    },
    {
      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Our allergy-friendly detached guesthouse (no pets, no smoke) and has a full kitchen, patio area & two playhouses.  It accommodates two adults and 2-3 (younger) kids, is in a safe, upscale neighborhood, and is within 10-15 minutes of all of San Diego's major attractions and is perfect for a couple or for a family.<br /><br />Guests love our location, amenities and hosting style.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />This 700 sq. ft. (65 sq. meters) modern, family-friendly guesthouse is located on your own upper view level behind our main house. <br /><br />The guesthouse is pretty, private, quiet, and in a safe, established neighborhood.  You have your own separate entrance, and the guesthouse has no shared walls or shared spaces. <br /><br />For guests who like all the details, read on:<br /><br />MISSION: Whether you’re traveling solo, with your partner, or with kids in tow, we strive to make your vacation tranquil, easy and joyful! As Airbnb guests ourselves, we understand the value of having a home away from home. We’ve stocked your guesthouse with everything: from the gear you need to relax at the beach to all of the tools you need to prepare meals or to pack sack lunches, including plentiful cooking utensils and cookware, Ziploc bags, aluminum foil, sharp kitchen knives, and bakeware, etc. For the kids we provide books, toys, fun play areas and baby gear to make traveling a little more enjoyable. <br /><br />OUTDOOR SPACE: You have the entire top level of our property to yourself.  For the kids, we have two playhouses to choose from: one that has a play kitchen and dining room (complete with dishes and tea set), and another that is set up like a camping cabin (with a cot and fun camping gear). <br /><br />Dine al fresco at the table for four on the patio or enjoy a glass of wine at the bistro table for two just outside of the master bedroom. Both options are enhanced by the soothing sounds of the cobalt blue fountain. <br /><br />BEDROOM: The king-size bed is topped with a memory foam pad, mattress cover, a cotton mattress pad, and 800 thread-count sheets.  You'll have a fluffy comforter and pillows with zippered, protective pillow covers and pillow cases.  Your bedside lamps have USB outlets to charge your phone. Two large closets with integrated dressers provide space for suitcases, folded, and hanging storage (two types of hangers provided). The guesthouse is equipped with its own dedicated remote-controlled dual-zone air conditioning (A/C) and heater system. Please take a look at the photos to see if this unique space fits your needs as the rolling partition wall in the bedroom does not provide sound-proof living (if traveling with kids). <br /><br />SLEEPING OPTIONS: We have two Crate & Barrel sleeping sofas in the living room that convert into: one twin (single) bed and one queen-size bed with comfy mattresses and fresh linens. And depending on your number/ages of kids, we also provide a Pack-n-Play for infants or a cot for toddlers to sleep in. What’s nice is that the kids don’t have to share one bed like they do in a hotel room. <br /><br />BATHROOM: Your bathroom is open concept to the bedroom, with a modular wall on wheels to transform the space according to your needs. The wall can swing around to enclose the bathtub/shower area.  It can also push out at night to create a wall to separate the bedroom from the living area. Please see photos and descriptions to make sure that this set up will work for your particular needs. <br /><br />LAUNDRY: Feel free to pack light and make use of your own brand new LG full-size washer & dryer with laundry detergent provided. <br /><br />KITCHEN:  Dine in, if you’d like! We’ve got everything:<br />- full-size refrigerator<br />- filtered reverse osmosis drinking water <br />- oven, stovetop, stainless steel pots and pans<br />- dishes, silverware, glasses, mugs, wine glasses<br />- wine bottle/beer openers<br />- sink and dishwasher (dish soap & detergent provided)<br />- microwave<br />- Keurig K-Cafe: (amazing!) coffee, latte and cappuccino maker <br />- electric kettle <br />- toaster, blender<br />- bakeware<br /><br />DINING AREA: The kitchen cabinetry holds all the accoutrements you need to set a fabulous table for four. There are also two adjustable bar stools at the counter, and infant seating is available upon request.<br /><br />LIVING ROOM: A 55-inch LG 4K smart TV is wall-mounted with a pivoting arm in the living space. It’s directly wired with an Ethernet cable for super fast streaming. There is no cable TV, however you’re invited log in to your Netflix, Prime, or Hulu, Disney+ or YouTube accounts. <br /><br />BEACH GEAR: Explore our world-class San Diego beaches like a local with a couple beach chairs that have integrated coolers, a couple boogie boards, some beach towels, some sand toys, and a beach umbrella.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />The entire upper level of our property is available for your use. It includes the guesthouse (with laundry inside), two kids’ playhouses, BBQ and patio and parking for one car.<br /><br />At various times of the year, we rent out our main house, as well. Both the main house and the guesthouse are separate from each other and on two different levels of our property. The driveway and front courtyard (to walk to your respective front doors) are the only shared spaces. <br /><br />To access the guesthouse, enter through the gated courtyard, pass the main house, and walk down the right side of the property, and up the stairs and you've arrived at your own, private Happy, Sparkling Clean Guesthouse!<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />We’ve designed the guesthouse to be used by two adults and two or three children, maybe four little kids if they like to snuggle. <br /><br />*If you have more than two adults, please don’t book the guesthouse.* <br /><br />With extended family in mind, we also rent our main house on the property that accommodates a larger family. So if you’re traveling with friends or family, check availability at our main house listing, which can accommodate up to four adults.  <br /><br />Please clean up after yourselves and leave the guesthouse pretty much how you found it. <br /><br />Since the guesthouse is on its own upper view terrace, you will need to climb 12 steps. <br /><br />We love our sleepy, quiet neighborhood and so do our neighbors. Please no music outside as the sound travels like crazy (and you won’t be able to hear the birds chirp).<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />STR-01289L, 615961"
      }
    },
