      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Elegant  bedroom  for two at my flat ( 100 sqm),  in the heart of the latin quarter, in front of Sorbonne University, with nice views, 5 minutes walk from Notre dame, Sainte Chapelle, Panthéon, Luxembourg Gardens, Conciergerie; 10 min walk from Saint germain des prés, café les Deux Magots. <br />Metro ( lines :10 and 4), buses ( lines :63,86,21,27,82,75) , RER C and B , supermakets, bakeries, fresh food markets just nearby. <br />Noisette, Flocon, and Bijou (my cats) are very sweet. I offer breakfast.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />You will sleep in a bedroom with a queen size bed. When I have guests I sleep in the tv room. <br /><br />I keep your bedroom door closed when you are away visiting Paris, so my cats don’t mingle with your belongings.<br /><br />It’s a classical parisian building with wooden floors that squeak a bit. <br /><br />Once you book, I can send you a video via whattsapp so you can check if it suits you; if not you can cancell the booking .  But I think you will like it! 😉 Nice views to the Sorbonne university, Collège de France and top of the Eiffel tower from the living room.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />It’s a shared space so you can use all rooms.<br /><br /><b>During your stay</b><br />You can contact me by whattsapp once the booking is made.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />I offer breakfast from arround 08:00 am to 9:30 . Later than that if I need to go out, I leave things ready and you helpyourselves."
