    {
      "id": "HIGHLIGHTS_DEFAULT",
      "highlights": "Vibrant neighborhood"
    },
    {
      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Immerse yourself in the exquisite privacy of our Love Room in the heart of Paris. Nestled in a central neighborhood, this luxurious retreat offers Parisian charm and sophisticated modernity. With our courier service and exclusive restaurant recommendations, your getaway will be unforgettable. Book now for a total immersion in the love and luxury of the City of Light. Easy access to transportation: Metro lines 4, 10, buses and Vélib. Close to many cafes and shops.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />The master bedroom is a masterpiece of design with an exposed beam ceiling and a bold mix of modern furniture and bright colors. The bed, with its futuristic lines and red and white elements, is complemented by a plush red carpet that adds warmth to the room. The large windows offer stunning views of the outside and flood the room with natural light.<br /><br />The seating area is equipped with modern chairs and a small table, perfect for a relaxing moment with views of the Parisian streets. A large flat screen and modern fireplace add to the comfort and warm atmosphere of the room.<br /><br />The bathroom, built into the bedroom, is an open space with clean lines and mosaic finishes of red and white. The facilities are modern and high quality, with a large rain shower and double sink. The glass partition between the bathroom and the bedroom keeps you open while offering privacy.<br /><br />The kitchenette, although compact, is perfectly equipped with modern appliances and minimalist design. The bright white surfaces reflect the light, creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere.<br /><br />The hallway leading to the bedroom offers a view of the bathroom through a glass wall, reinforcing the impression of space and continuity in the apartment. The separate bathroom is modern and functional, with neat finishes and smart storage.<br /><br />In short, this apartment skillfully combines historical and contemporary elements to create a unique, stylish and comfortable living space, ideal for those who appreciate modern design in a historic setting.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Services included<br /><br />- Daily refreshment cleaning<br />- Support available throughout the stay<br /><br />Extra services (not included)<br /><br />- Private driver<br />- Any other service on request<br />- Breakfast<br />- Florist<br />- Coursier<br />- Multi-technical service<br />- Pet care/ food<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />7512345678912"
      }
