    {
      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Welcome to Thunder Mountain Chateau, your private sanctuary in the heart of West Sedona. This home is located within walking distance to the Sugarloaf Trailhead or a quick 3-minute drive to 2 other famous trailheads in West Sedona. At the end of the day, enjoy the hot tub, grill, and fire pit in the back yard while taking in views of Thunder Mountain. Minutes to shops and restaurants! Come enjoy everything Sedona has to offer—we look forward to hosting you!<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Warm, cozy, and inviting, this home will provide you and your travel mates a wonderful sanctuary to rest and recharge after a long day on the trails or sightseeing. This home features 3 full-sized bedrooms and an additional sleeping nook off the main master bedroom, which is best used for children or related parties (see details below). If you have any questions, please reach out. We are here to help and make sure you have a wonderful time in Sedona! <br /><br />BEDROOMS & BATHROOMS<br /><br />✔ High quality oh-so-comfortable mattress<br />✔ Fresh crisp linens provided<br />✔ Squeaky clean bathrooms<br /><br />Bedroom 1 (King Bed) + Sleeping Nook: The primary bedroom is large and very private from the other two bedrooms. There is an adjacent sleeping nook located off the primary bedroom (see photos) with a twin trundle bed that can sleep two people comfortably. Please note that guests in the sleeping nook will either share the primary bathroom or walk through the primary bedroom to access a bathroom. The sleeping nook is best used for children or related parties who are comfortable with one another. <br /><br />Bedroom 2 (Queen Bed): Located on the opposite side of the house off of the kitchen area. Please note that this bedroom shares a bathroom with Bedroom 3. <br /><br />Bedroom 3 (Queen Bed): Located on the opposite side of the house off of the kitchen area. Please note that this bedroom shares a bathroom with Bedroom 2. <br /><br />KITCHEN, DINING, LIVING<br /><br />✔ Fully equipped kitchen<br />✔ Locally roasted coffee provided<br />✔ Updated appliances<br />✔ Breakfast Nook + Bar Seating<br />✔ Large dining table <br />✔ Washer/Dryer<br /><br />OUTSIDE, DECK, PARKING<br /><br />✔ Outside dining w/ Red Rock Views<br />✔ Large private backyard with seating<br />✔ 8-seater hot tub<br />✔ Garage access to store mountain bikes and other valuables<br />✔ Ample parking<br /><br />LOCATION<br /><br />✔ 4 minutes walk to Sugar Loaf Trailhead <br />✔ 4 minutes Amitabha Stupa and Peace Park<br />✔ 5 Andante Trailhead<br />✔ 5 minutes to Thunder Mountain Trailhead<br />✔ 8 minutes to Devil’s Bridge Trailhead<br />✔ 4 minutes or less to Safeway, 5 minutes to Natural Grocers, and 6 minutes to Whole Foods<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />You will have access to the entire home. This is a wonderful home in a very quiet and peaceful neighborhood in West Sedona.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />TPT 21461113<br />Sedona 032545"
