      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Welcome to Loft & Terrace with Amazing Castle View at Baixa in Lisbon downtown.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />NOTICE:<br />The 1st bedroom is semi-open to the living room. <br />The 2nd bedroom is the bedroom with door. <br /><br />Although the building has the elevator, we took it out from the list of the ammenities since it was always stopping due to the misusage. It is very small elevator and when people get in with many luggages, it forces the inner door and it stops.<br />So, at this moment, we are renting the flat as if the building does not have the elevator. You might have the elevator while you are staying or not. So if you really need or want the elevator, we recommend you to book other apartments we have with the lift: https://www.airbnb.pt/wishlists/3055953<br />Thank you for your understanding. <br /><br /><br />Here is some pratical information about the apartment.<br />THE APARTMENT:<br />• Spacious living room with 2 confortable sofas, TV (Cable TV), Bluetooth Bose sound system and 1 dining table with 4 chairs<br />• 2 Rooms:<br />     1) Bedroom 1 - Double bed with air conditioning and closet. This room is semi-open to the living room.<br />     2) Bedroom 2 - Double bed with air conditioning. <br />• 1 Kitchen with Microwave, Oven, Dish Washer, Fridge, Washing Machine / Dryer and all the electronic appliances needed for breakfast (toaster, nespresso coffee machine, ketlle, etc)<br />• 2 bathrooms:<br />     1) Bathroom 1 - Shower and Toilet<br />     2) Bathroom 2 - Only Toilet. <br />• 5th floor <br />• Free WiFi and Cable TV<br />• Air conditioning at the living room and bedrooms<br />• Other equipments: 1 Bluetooth Bose Sound System and 1 Hair Dryer<br />• We provide linen and towels. <br /><br />LOCATION/TOURIST POINTS: <br />• The building is located in front of the subway station of Rossio (Green Line). 5 min from the subway station of Baixa-Chiado (Green and Blue Line).<br />• 30 seconds from Rossio Square, the center of Lisbon!<br />• 1 minute from Martim Moniz Square where you can catch the famous tram 28. <br />• 15 min from famous \"Brasileira\" coffee shop, Garrett street (Rua Garrett), Bairro Alto, 5 min from Santa Justa Elevator, 7 min from Praça do Comércio.<br />• Several coffee shops, supermarkets, shops and restaurants in walking distance.<br />• 30 min by taxi from the airport.<br /><br />HOW TO GET TO THE APARTMENT:<br />•TAXI – It takes about 30 min from the airport.<br />• Subway – You can get Red Line from the airport and change to Green Line at \"Alameda\" station. Then get off at \"Rossio\" station. The apartment is just in front of the one of the exits to Praça da Figueira. The subway trip takes about 40 min.<br /><br />License Number - 9179/AL<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />9179/AL"
      }
