      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Welcome to Bella Nova, a stunning 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom retreat in the heart of Joshua Tree. This brand-new home blends modern luxury with the beauty of the desert, creating the perfect escape for families, friends, or anyone looking to unwind in style.<br /><br />Highlights:<br /><br />- Resort-style backyard with a pool, spa, and sunken fire pit.<br />- Floor-to-ceiling windows with breathtaking desert views.<br />- Gourmet kitchen and spacious open-concept living area.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />This spacious 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom home is designed with your comfort in mind. Each bedroom features plush bedding, ample closet space, and an en-suite bathroom for maximum privacy and convenience. The open-concept living area boasts contemporary furnishings and large sliders that flood the space with the natural desert light, showcasing the desert views and creating an indoor/outdoor living vibe.<br /><br />Outdoor Living:<br /><br />Step outside and immerse yourself in your private desert oasis. The expansive outdoor area includes:<br /><br />Sunken Firepit: Gather around the stylish sunken firepit, perfect for stargazing and sharing stories under the night sky.<br /><br />Pool & Spa: Take a refreshing dip in the pool or unwind in the spa while soaking in the serene surroundings.<br /><br />Sun Beds: Lounge in comfort on our sun loungers, ideal for sunbathing or relaxing with a good book.<br /><br />Built-in BBQ: Enjoy alfresco dining with the built-in BBQ, complete with all the essentials for a perfect cookout.<br /><br />Highlights Include:<br /><br />➤ Great views<br />➤ In-ground pool with spa<br />➤ Sun loungers<br />➤ Built in BBQ<br />➤ Both indoor and out door dining areas<br />➤ High-speed WiFi<br />➤ Fully equipped kitchen with modern appliances<br />➤ Washer and dryer<br />➤ Central heating and air conditioning<br />➤ Smart TVs in the living room and all bedrooms<br />➤ Ample parking space<br /><br />Location:<br /><br />Nestled in the picturesque landscape of Joshua Tree, our home offers easy access to the Joshua Tree National Park, renowned for its stunning rock formations and vibrant wildlife. Explore nearby hiking trails, visit local art galleries and attractions, or simply relax and enjoy the tranquility of the desert.<br /><br />4 minutes ➔ Joshua Tree National Park Visitors Center<br />4 minutes ➔ Joshua Tree Coffee<br />11 minutes ➔ Frontier Cafe and Old Town Yucca Valley<br />17 minutes ➔ Pappy & Harriet’s<br />17 minutes ➔ La Copine<br />42 minutes ➔ Palm Springs<br /><br />Whether you're seeking adventure in the great outdoors or a peaceful retreat, our modern oasis in Joshua Tree has everything you need for an unforgettable stay. Book now and start creating memories that will last a lifetime!<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Guests will have full access to the entire property, including the pool, spa, firepit, and BBQ area.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Pool/Hot tub heating:  The hot tub heating is included with your booking.  The pool can be heated for an additional fee of $225 per day.<br /><br />Please note this house is in a quiet, residential area. Quiet hours are from 10 pm to 9 am.<br /><br />Pet Friendly:  We're pet friendly!  Two well-behaved pups allowed.  There is a $125 pet fee, paid at time of booking.<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />CESTRP-2024-00592"
