    {
      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Inspired by Cycladic Mediterranean architecture, the highlight of La Cave is undoubtedly the beautiful cave pool and spa, providing a private and serene space for you to relax and unwind. The interior of the house is designed to complement the natural surroundings, with earthy tones and natural materials throughout. This unique home is the perfect place to make unforgettable memories. Experience the magic of the desert like never before!!<br /><br />@CasaCabin<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Introducing our breathtaking new Airbnb retreat nestled in the heart of Joshua Tree, a true fusion of Cycladic charm and desert serenity. Inspired by the iconic architecture of the Greek Cycladic islands, this unique desert oasis promises an unforgettable escape.<br /><br />As you step onto the property, you'll be transported to a world of whitewashed simplicity and organic elegance, reminiscent of the quaint villages of Greece. The pristine exterior, adorned with rounded edges and minimalist lines, seamlessly blends into the rugged Joshua Tree landscape.<br /><br />The centerpiece of this remarkable retreat is a private saltwater cave pool and spa, carefully carved into the rocky terrain. Dive into the crystal-clear waters or unwind in the soothing warmth of the spa, all while surrounded by the natural beauty of the desert. Lush vegetation and indigenous flora create a secluded haven, offering both tranquility and privacy.<br /><br />Inside, you'll find a meticulously designed interior that marries Cycladic aesthetics with modern comfort. Sun-soaked rooms are adorned with soothing whites and earthy ocean tones, providing a harmonious contrast to the desert's vibrant hues. The open-plan living space with an arch bunk bed seamlessly connects to a fully-equipped kitchen, inviting guests to create culinary masterpieces.<br /><br />Enjoy panoramic views of Joshua Tree's iconic rock formations while savoring Mediterranean-inspired cuisine or simply gazing at the starry night sky.<br /><br />Whether you're seeking a peaceful retreat, a romantic getaway, or a luxurious escape, our Joshua Tree Airbnb inspired by Cycladic architecture guarantees a unique and rejuvenating experience. Unplug, relax, and let the harmonious blend of Greece and the desert enchant your senses, making your stay an unforgettable memory.<br /><br />Follow us @casacabin<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />The entire space. <br /><br />If you would like to sleep more guests, consider booking our property next door 'Scenic Cabin Getaway'. Link in profile.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />*The pool and spa are both saltwater. The pool can be heated for an additional fee of $150 per day. There is a $60 per day fee to heat the spa. $200 a day to heat both due to the cost of propane in our remote area. Please contact 4 hours before you want the pool heated.<br /><br />The pool and spa are connected by a shelf. The spa is in the back part of the cave.<br /><br />Half of the pool gets sun most of the day. You can choose to lounge in the sun or enjoy reading a book in the shade knowing you don't need to apply sunscreen. :-)<br /><br />The pool and spa have a pool cover that you can close when the pool is not in use.<br /><br /><br />**ALL WATER ACTIVITY IS undertaken AT ONE'S OWN RISK. NO LIFEGUARD ON DUTY. A Pool/SPA cover IS ON PREMISES AND IS TO BE ACTIVATED by GUEST(S), as guest deems necessary. POOL AND HOT TUB AREA IS OPEN ALL areas of the property. GUEST(S) AND/OR ANY SUBCONTRACTORS AND THE LIKE RELEASE HOST(S) ON ANY/ALL LIABILITY ASSOCIATED WITH POOL/HOT TUB USAGE.<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />CESTRP-2024-00013"
