        "htmlText": "Obsidian Joshua Tree is a luxurious desert sanctuary, offering breathtaking snowcapped mountain views and an infinity-edge pool with a unique clear window that seamlessly blends with the horizon. <br /><br />Inside, custom art pieces and a thoughtfully curated design create an atmosphere of serene elegance. This exclusive retreat offers an unparalleled experience, where nature's beauty and refined luxury come together in perfect harmony.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Amenities include:<br />-Starlink Internet<br />-Miele Appliances<br />-Parachute Linens<br />-Sonos Sound System<br />-Endless Boulder Views<br />-Suspended Orb Fireplace<br />-Infinity Edge Pool + Hot Tub<br />-Large Covered Patio with TV<br />-Solid Granite Block Soaking Tub<br />-Largest Sliding Doors In The Desert<br />-Sunken firepit made from solid stone<br />-Custom Black Walnut Relief Carvings<br /><br /><br />Nestled in the heart of the high desert, this architectural masterpiece is oriented to frame breathtaking, snowcapped views of Mt. San Gorgonio. The infinity-edge pool serves as the home's centerpiece, offering a seamless connection to the surrounding landscape. Its board-formed concrete exterior and sunken seating area invite moments of tranquility, while a stone firepit, hand-carved from cantera, offers warmth under the open sky.<br /><br />Crafted with weathered hot-rolled steel, the home’s exterior is designed to blend harmoniously with its environment. Inside, 14-foot sliding glass doors create a fluid transition between the indoors and the outdoors, bringing nature's beauty inside.<br /><br />The pool is thoughtfully aligned along the prevailing winds, enhancing summer comfort through natural evaporative cooling.<br /><br />Each interior wall mirrors the materials found outside, creating an uninterrupted flow that gives the impression of solid, monolithic slabs.<br /><br />The kitchen, a collaboration with renowned local craftsmen Aaron Wood and Dan Tarro, features custom ebonized red oak cabinetry. Leathered granite countertops evoke a refined yet organic aesthetic.<br /><br />The dining area showcases a floating black walnut bench by Aaron Wood, illuminated by a light fixture from A-N-D Light. Additional seating by Studio Nordhaven creates a space for both intimate gatherings and expansive views.<br /><br />In the living room, a bioethanol hanging fireplace by Fireorb offers warmth and ambiance, while a unique carved gneiss boulder serves as an artful coffee table.<br /><br />The bedrooms are a sanctuary of custom craftsmanship, adorned with black walnut relief art pieces by Aaron Wood. Open corner retracting glass walls frame the dramatic high desert vistas, bringing the outdoors into your space.<br /><br />In the master bathroom, a 5,000-pound granite block soaking tub takes center stage, with the raw extraction drill marks left exposed to highlight its natural beauty. Silver travertine accents the microcement shower, completing the luxurious, minimalist design.<br /><br />The guest bathroom continues the home’s theme of artistry, with a carved black walnut drawer front and silver travertine supports, also by Aaron Wood.<br /><br />This desert retreat is the ultimate fusion of nature, craftsmanship, and modern luxury—an ideal sanctuary for those seeking serenity, style, and breathtaking views.<br /><br /><br />* 12 minutes » Downtown Joshua Tree<br />* ﻿﻿16 minutes » West Entrance to Joshua Tree National Park<br />* ﻿﻿15 minutes » Pioneertown and Pappy &Harriet's<br />* ﻿﻿45 minutes » Palm Springs<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Guests will have unrestricted access to the entire property during your stay.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Events and Commercial Photoshoots:<br />Please inquire for more details.<br /><br />Pool Heating:<br />Should you wish to have the pool heated (84 degrees max) during your stay, please notify us in advance of your arrival. There will be a supplemental per day charge for this service.<br /><br />June - September → $150/day (two day minimum)<br />October - May → $250/day (two day minimum)<br /><br />Spa Heating:<br />Spa heating is always included with each rental (max temp 102 degrees).<br /><br />Pool Service:<br />To keep the pool as pristine as possible, the pool is serviced every Sunday and Wednesday. Our pool technician will go directly to the backyard to work on the pool in order to respect your privacy. If you are in the pool at the time feel free to ask him to come back at a later time.<br /><br />Pets:<br />Dogs only, maximum 2 - $120/stay<br /><br />Early Check-In:<br />$75 for up to 2 hour early check, if available.<br /><br />Late Check-Out:<br />We are unable to accommodate late checkouts.<br /><br />A stay by @aboveandbeyondjt"
