      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Wagli36 is a unique chalet in Wagliseiboden, Sörenberg, at 1318m in the UNESCO Biosphere. It offers stunning 180-degree views of the mountains.<br /><br />If you are looking for authentic nature, silence, dark nights to watch the stars and the Milky Way, numerous hiking paths, and biking routes in summer, or snowshoe trails, Nordic skiing, or ski tours right from your chalet, then this is the holiday home for you.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />The house is on two levels and half-open with a mezzanine. This makes it unique as the views from the inside are very open.<br />Be aware, that the main bed is on the mezzanine. The layout is appropriate for 2 adults and can be used for additional 2 people who know each other very well since the smaller rooms open on the mezzanine (see layout picture). The house is not adapted for small children though, since it doesn't have the required safety devices (e.g. staircase, electric plugs, kitchen drawers).<br /><br />The house has a full window front. All square windows have electric blinds, but not the other small ones. Therefore, a sleeping mask (provided in the house) may be comfortable for light sensible people.<br /><br />The house has fiber optic internet (high speed)<br /><br />We offer the following on-demand and for free:<br /><br />- Snowshoes<br />- Sledge<br />- Mini-Bob<br /><br />We offer the following on-demand and at a cost:<br /><br />- Massage provided by a very experienced physiotherapist. The massage takes place at your Wagli36 home! <br /><br />- Sauna: We live next door and are happy to offer our sauna for your use whenever we are home. For your comfort, we provide bathrobes and ensure full privacy with access via the terrace. In the same room, you’ll also find a deep bathtub, which we can fill with refreshing 8°C cold water upon request. The price is CHF 50, regardless of the number of guests or duration of use.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />The house is yours, along with the surrounding garden.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />.<br />G r o c e r y:<br />There is a small grocery shop named VOLG in Sörenberg, which is 5km away. It opens seven days a week from 7:00 to 19:00<br /><br />R e s t a u r a n t s <br />(always check the internet for opening hours):<br />- BERGWELTEN SALWIDELI: 10mn walk away. Upscale and elegant setting with a refined menu<br />- RISCHLI: 3km drive away. Upscale and elegant setting with a refined menu<br />- ALPENRÖSLI: 5km drive away. Casual dining, swiss authentic cuisine<br />- BÄCKERSTUBE: 5km drive away. Casual dining, also pizza take-away possible<br />- GASTHOOF 18: 7.5km drive away. Casual dining at the Golf Club Flühli<br /><br />V I S I T S :<br />Interlaken: 1 hour and 30 minutes / 100km<br />Grindelwald: 2 hours / 120km<br />Lauterbrunnen, Mürren: 2 hours / 110km<br />Berne: 1 hour and 20 minutes / 70km<br />Lucerne: 1 hour / 50km"
