      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Welcome to our villa near Lake Como, nestled in the charming city of Valbrona, celebrated for biking, climbing, hiking and much more. Our apartment has a breathtaking view of the lake and mountains. The apartment features a spacious 70-square-meter private terrace overlooking the lake. Given the secluded location, we suggest traveling by car, there’s no public transportation nearby the house (closest bus stop is 1,2km away).<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Welcome to our two-bedroom apartment, perfect for up to 5 guests. There’s two large queen-size bedroom, (one has a sofa bed for the fifth person) equipped with smart TVs offering free Netflix and Prime Video. The living area/kitchen create a cozy space, while a spacious private terrace outside the bedrooms provides a fantastic view of Lake Como and the mountains. <br /><br />With a private entrance and a small garden, the apartment offers tranquility just 1.2 kilometers from Valbrona's center. Ideal for those with cars seeking nature and relaxation. Explore hiking trails right outside, leading to the lake or up the mountains.<br /><br />For your convenience, stock up on groceries before arriving, as the nearest large supermarket is \"Familia\" in Canzo, 15 minutes away. <br />In Valbrona, there's a small grocery store, \"La Bottega,\" with limited hours and a butcher called “Roberto Barindelli” that has very good meat produced in the nearby area.<br /><br />A 10-minute drive takes you to the lake, offering various beach bars and restaurants, some providing boat or kayak rentals. Alternatively, enjoy free beaches for swimming and picnicking.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Our guests have access to private parking outside the house and a dedicated entrance, along with a charming garden. <br />The terrace is private only for our guests and it’s including a gas barbecue that is ready to use. <br /><br />As you approach the parking area, navigate through a narrow curve with caution, maintaining a slow speed. Although even large cars and small trucks can pass easily, it's important to exercise care.<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />IT013229C275KZDI9O"
