        "htmlText": "Luxury garden suite w/ private entrance, private bathroom, and hot tub in one of SF's hottest neighborhoods - the Mission. No shared spaces in this quiet Inner Mission one-bedroom w/ large living room, Xfinity, Apple TV, hi-speed Wi-Fi. Lots of room to spread out & relax. Strict cleaning regimen incl 30-min UVC light treatment per room, min 24-hour vacancy, sterile wipe down of all common surfaces.  Please check our location on map relative to places you plan to visit in SF. Please: no smoking.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />This luxury garden suite has lots of privacy and quiet bedroom. A spacious living room with TV, comfortable bedroom with reading lights, and private spa-like bathroom (dual rain shower heads, double vanity, lighted makeup mirror, and Toto bidet toilet) provide plenty of room to spread out and relax after a day of touring or business in the Bay Area. We provide 100% cotton towels and linens, amenities include Aveda shampoo &  conditioner, shower gel, a refrigerator stocked with complimentary water, wine, beer, snacks, along with Nespresso coffee & espresso. The suite is thoroughly cleaned between guests, including 30-minute UVC 'blue light' treatment to each room, all common surfaces wiped down with disinfectant.  All bedding (mattress pads, 2x pillow protectors, duvet cover, everything) is thoroughly cleaned. 24-hour vacancy: no back-to-back bookings means deep cleaning for every guest.  Comforter is goose down but a hypoallergenic option is available. Hand sanitizer and disinfectant wipes provided. Please note this is a no smoking property.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Prior to your stay, we'll send information for coordinating your arrival.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Otis Gladstone the English Bulldog will give you kisses and ask for a back rub if he comes to say hello, but he shouldn't enter the bedroom in the unit.<br />The backyard was designed by award-winning landscape design firm and nursery Flora Grubb Garden. <br />We comply with San Francisco's Business Registration and Short Term Rental  requirements: account number one zero two four three nine two<br />This is a no smoking property<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />STR-0001626"
