      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Enjoy a quiet and elegant stay in our little house, which combines Canarian architecture with Mediterranean touches. Relax in the private patio under the outdoor pergola, perfect for outdoor moments; enjoy the views of the magical mountain of Tindaya and the sunsets in a rural setting next to volcanoes and traditional mills.<br />Villaverde, with its quiet atmosphere and rich gastronomy, is ideal for disconnecting and exploring.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />El Belingo is located in the rural village of Villaverde, which belongs to the municipality of La Oliva, less than 2 km away. <br />A few steps away you have a bus stop, a supermarket and 3 of the best restaurants in the Municipality: El Mahoh Restaurant, La Villa and the exquisite Locanda Ill Gato Rosso. Less than 2 km away are the mythical and renowned Canarian restaurants El Horno and Casa Marcos.<br />1.5 km away there is an ATM, pharmacy, gas station, post office, cafes, local shops .... and the Traditional Market of La Oliva. <br /><br />You can reach the well-known village of Lajares in less than 7 minutes by car, El Cotillo and Corralejo in 15 minutes, and most surf peaks in 15 to 30 minutes. <br /><br />About the accommodation: <br /><br />El Belingo, a charming little old stone house that has been renovated with a lot of magic. Its charm and attention to detail will captivate you.<br /><br />El Belingo is distributed in a room with a bathroom in suite with a work table with an internet connection by Fiber Optic/Wifi in which they have a bluetooth table/speaker with battery to connect your devices and a Smart TV to enjoy your favorite subscriptions during your stay. <br />You can connect the TV to the Bluetooth speaker to enjoy better ambient sound in the room. <br /><br />In the private courtyard, enjoy our intimate, comfortable, and safe swimming pool where you can have a drink and enjoy the moment on its indoor bench. <br />The wooden pergola will give you enough shade to rest from the strong sun that characterizes Fuerteventura. <br /><br />With the charm that characterizes the typical old Canarian houses, the kitchen is located across the courtyard. The outdoor dining room under the pergola overlooking Morro de Tababaire and the perfectly equipped kitchenette is designed for you to enjoy your moments and have all the amenities you need; don't forget that the town of Villaverde has a wide gastronomic variety as well as the nearby towns. <br /><br />In the outdoor area, you have an outdoor shower with hot water; showering under the stars of the night with a gentle rain of warm water... A pleasure! <br /><br />We also have an outdoor table and chairs, a barbecue, and sun loungers. <br /><br />You can clean your sports gear at the outdoor taps and be even more comfortable inside without sand.<br /><br />Belingo does not have the necessary equipment for babies and its environment and design is not the most suitable for a stay with children.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />El Belingo is an intimate space; you will have your total privacy, entrance and independent parking.<br /><br />You'll have all the necessary amenities during your stay. <br />If you need anything, don't hesitate to contact me. I'll be happy to help you.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Thanks to the sun ☀️that shines on us every day, we have a solar panel system (without batteries since they pollute a lot); take advantage of the daylight hours to use the washing machine. 😊<br /><br />Thank you. ♻️<br /><br />Our house is in a rural area where, like most houses in Fuerteventura, it has a domestic sewage treatment system that filters all the water to reuse it for irrigation. <br />That's why you should NOT flush paper, wet wipes, or intimate hygiene products down the toilet due to the risk of clogging. <br />All these products must go into the trash can and then into the garbage containers. <br /><br />Any clog in our water purification system will be a serious problem for the entire house and the repair will not be immediate or convenient. <br />We ask you and appreciate your strict compliance with this, or you will have to pay for the repair and the resulting damages. <br /><br />Thank you very much for your understanding and cooperation. <br /><br />ECO-LIVING! ♻️<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />VV-35-2-0007498"
