      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Experience a truly memorable holiday in this stylish, historic Canary Island home, just steps from the beach with stunning southeast views of the ocean. <br /><br />Built in 1912 and lovingly preserved, this house radiates unique character and vibrant colour, capturing the essence of authentic island life with its original features intact.<br /><br />Whether you’re exploring nearby coastal gems or enjoying the serenity of your private oasis, this house provides an unforgettable escape.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Immerse yourself in the charm of history at this two-story traditional Canarian home, located just steps from the beach and offering breathtaking ocean views. This home's original architecture and unique character seamlessly blend authenticity, comfort, and style.<br /><br />- A stunning stone terrace with ocean views<br /><br />Step onto your private terrace and take in unbeatable beach and ocean views. Perfect for relaxing or dining alfresco, the terrace offers a variety of seating options to suit every occasion. Enjoy the soothing sound of waves as you unwind in this idyllic outdoor space.<br /><br />- Living and dining with spectacular beach views<br /><br />The cosy living and dining room is designed for comfort and charm, offering direct beach and ocean views. Highlights include:<br /><br />•  Comfortable sofa seating<br />•  A flat-screen Smart TV<br />•  A dining table with chairs and window seat, perfectly positioned by the window for picturesque meals. <br /><br />- Fully equipped kitchen for your culinary needs<br /><br />The separate kitchen is both functional and well-appointed, with everything you need to prepare meals or snacks, including:<br /><br />•  Oven and gas stove<br />•  Microwave<br />•  Fridge-freezer<br />•  Italian moka pot for coffee lovers<br />•  A complete set of cookware, utensils, and dinnerware<br /><br />- Cosy bedrooms with unique character<br /><br />Located on the first floor, the two bedrooms are separated by the main bathroom for privacy. Each room is thoughtfully furnished with high-quality furniture, some of which have been upcycled for a modern touch.<br /><br />Master bedroom: Features a king-size bed (180cm), ample wardrobe and drawer space, and a table and chairs by the window with spectacular beach and ocean views. Electric sun-blocking blinds ensure restful mornings.<br /><br />Twin bedroom: This room includes two single beds (90cm), a spacious wardrobe, a desk, and charming decor. It also provides access to the first-floor terrace.<br /><br />- Modern bathroom <br /><br />The spacious main bathroom includes a large walk-in shower, sink, and toilet. A utility cupboard holds a washing machine and cleaning supplies for added convenience.<br /><br />- First-floor terrace: a sun-filled oasis<br /><br />The colourful first-floor terrace is a hidden gem. It offers a peaceful retreat with sunloungers where you can soak up the Canary Islands’ year-round sunshine. Enjoy the tranquillity of this space while taking in the serene atmosphere.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />You will have access to the whole house and the terraces during your stay.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />CHECK-IN / CHECK-OUT<br /><br />Check-in time is from 4pm and check-out is by 11am. <br /><br />ONLINE CHECK-IN BEFORE ARRIVAL<br /><br />In accordance with the current Vacation Rental Decree (Spanish law), we kindly request all guests to submit their ID prior to arrival. If you have any questions or need assistance, please feel free to reach out to us.<br /><br />TOWELS, LINEN AND PROFESSIONAL CLEANING<br /><br />The apartment is always professionally cleaned between guests and maintained to a high standard. <br /><br />We provide all bed linen, 1 bath towel, 1 hand towel, 1 beach towel per guest, and 1 hand towel and bath mat for each bathroom. <br /><br />Please send us a message to request a change of towels and bed linen during your stay of 7 days or more. <br /><br />MID-STAY CLEANING <br /><br />Mid-stay cleaning is available for €20 an hour (minimum 3 hours). If you want us to arrange this, send us a message.  <br /><br />FAMILIES<br /><br />We welcome families travelling with infants and offer a baby pack on request to help you travel lightly and comfortably. <br /><br />Our baby pack includes a travel cot with a bottom sheet and a highchair, and it is available for €30 per reservation. <br /><br />Please let us know if you require this, and we'll be happy to assist you<br /><br />REMOTE WORKING<br /><br />If you plan to work remotely during your stay, you can rent a 22-inch monitor with HDMI cable for €30. Send us a message to request this."
