      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "We invite you to experience the city from the authentic comfort of this late 1800s spacious apartment accommodating up to 6 people!<br /><br />Tall majestic Limestone Walls frame a unique blend of antique, vintage, and handmade furniture, textiles, and details, and make the space a feast for the eyes. <br /><br />An elegant master bedroom with an chaise longue and work space, a cozy secondary bedroom, and a romantic bed nook accessible from the living room/kitchen space make for a comfortable and  memorable stay.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />This exceptional apartment sleeps 6 people divided on 3 beds with its two bedrooms as well as a cozy bed nook screened off from the living room/kitchen area. <br /><br />The  master bedroom features a king size bed, a smart desk space, a comfortable chaise longue, and a smart TV tucked away in a charming chinoiserie cabinet, while the secondary bedroom features a queen bed. <br /><br />The open kitchen in the living room space is fully equipped for your cooking needs, and the dining area has plenty of seating space, combining a comfortable sofa with practical chairs. Lower seating is also available in this room, as is the aforementioned sleep nook/daybed.<br /><br />The apartment itself is strictly non-smoking but there is a small privately accessed semi-open area in front of the apartment door with seating and a small table where smoking is allowed.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />All parts of the apartment, including the small sitting area in front of the apartment door is accessible to guests only."
