        "htmlText": "The Mérinide Suite has its own bathroom and is air-conditioned. It is located at Riad Matham, in a quiet and secure area. The souks, Jemaa el-Fnaa square, monuments and good restaurants are within walking distance.<br />Breakfast included in the price of the room is served every morning. Tourist tax of 26dhs per person, per night is not included.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Its location is ideal, 3 minutes from the main museums (Ben Youssef Madrasa, Museum of Marrakech, House of Photography) and colorful souks and 8 minutes from Jemaa el-Fnaa square, with taxi parking nearby.<br />Around the large patio garden adorned with palm trees, olive trees, bougainvillea, with the scents of jasmine and orange blossom, the house offers two bedrooms and 4 suites, a large living room with fireplace and an open living room (bhou) on the ornamental and swimming pool.<br />A wide corridor, rest and reading area as well as a hammam are at your disposal upstairs.<br />Relaxation areas (solarium, shower, Berber tent) and conviviality await you on the 220 m² terrace which offers a 360° view of the medina. Great for enjoying a romantic dinner or an aperitif with friends.<br />The rooms combine simplicity, comfort and romance. They have retained their old charm (painted ceilings 4.5 m high, \"rtaj\" doors, plaster stucco). Some have their own indoor living room."
