      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Escape to a one-of-a-kind artistic retreat, where nature and design come together in perfect harmony. This handcrafted studio, just a 5-minute walk from the Pyramids of Giza, offers an immersive experience with natural materials, bespoke handmade furniture, and breathtaking pyramids views right from your private jacuzzi.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />🌿 Unique Handcrafted Design: Every detail of this space is made from natural materials, creating a warm and earthy ambiance.<br /><br />🌅 Spectacular Pyramids View: Wake up to an unobstructed view of the Great Pyramids right from your cozy sofa or enjoy it while soaking in your private jacuzzi.<br /><br />🛏 Comfort & Style: Relax in a luxurious 160x200 bed with handmade bedside tables and a uniquely crafted natural-wood wardrobe.<br /><br />📺 Modern Amenities: Stay entertained with a Smart TV, and enjoy a cozy dining area with a one-of-a-kind handcrafted wooden table and chairs.<br /><br />🍽 Well-Equipped Kitchenette: Cook with ease using the cooktop, mini fridge, microwave, sink, and all essentials.<br /><br />🛁 Private Jacuzzi: Unwind in your indoor jacuzzi, surrounded by lush greenery and a tranquil atmosphere.<br /><br />🌿 Nature-Infused Atmosphere: The studio is enriched with indoor plants, organic textures, and rustic wooden elements, making it feel like a true nature retreat.<br /><br />📍 Prime Location: Nestled in a vibrant area with restaurants, cafés, and local markets within walking distance.<br /><br />✨ This studio is more than just a place to stay—it’s a piece of art where every detail tells a story. Come and enjoy an unforgettable stay right next to one of the world’s greatest wonders!<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Guests will have full private access to the studio, including:<br /><br />✔ A private jacuzzi with a stunning Pyramids view<br />✔ A fully equipped kitchenette (cooktop, mini fridge, microwave, sink)<br />✔ A smart TV and dining area<br />✔ A comfortable king-size bed (160x200) with unique handmade furniture<br />✔ A private bathroom<br /><br />Additionally, guests will have exclusive access to the shared rooftop, where they can enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of the Pyramids—perfect for sunrise, sunset, or a relaxing evening under the stars.<br /><br />☕ Breakfast is included and will be served fresh every morning.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Location & Surroundings<br /><br />This studio is located in the heart of Giza’s most touristic area, just a 5-minute walk from the entrance of the Great Pyramids of Giza. The neighborhood is vibrant and full of life, offering a unique blend of history, culture, and local energy.<br /><br />🌍 A True Egyptian Experience: As you step outside, you'll find yourself immersed in the authentic hustle and bustle of Giza—from camel handlers and souvenir vendors to the lively sounds of daily life. The area is always buzzing with tourists, giving you an exciting and immersive experience.<br /><br />🍽 Food & Dining: The streets are lined with local and international restaurants, cafés, and street food vendors, offering everything from traditional Egyptian cuisine to global flavors.<br /><br />🛍 Shops & Bazaars: Explore nearby markets and bazaars where you can shop for handcrafted souvenirs, local spices, and unique artisan pieces.<br /><br />🚕 Easy Transportation: Taxis, ride-hailing services, and tour operators are readily available, making it easy to explore other landmarks in Cairo, such as the Egyptian Museum, Khan El Khalili Bazaar, and the Nile River.<br /><br />💡 Pro Tip: If you prefer to avoid street hassle, a simple “La, Shukran” (No, thank you) is an effective way to move around smoothly.<br /><br />This location offers the perfect mix of history, culture, and vibrant city life, making your stay a truly memorable experience!"
