    {
      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Enjoy swimming, kayaking & snorkelling on the doorstep and spectacular oceanfront views in this gated-community home on the water at the eastern tip of Nassau. Experience the sunrise & moonrise off the back patio and - in winter - awesome sunsets. Here you'll find the REAL Bahamas, away from the busy tourism hubs yet within a 15-minute drive. Includes a generator for back-up power. *WARNING: Please book directly with Airbnb and NOT 3rd-party companies or anyone using my name outside of Airbnb.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />When people walk into this home they are immediately struck by the spa-like tranquility and ocean views from nearly every window; the patio and deck leading directly to the sea; and at night by the blanket of stars that light up the sky. And oh, did I mention the ocean? It's literally right on your back-doorstep. Feel free to use the kayaks and snorkelling equipment and really explore the \"back garden\". The interior decor of Sunrise by the Sea reflects the colours of the sea and provides a peaceful yet rejuvenating haven for a truly therapeutic and fun vacation.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />The entire home is at your disposal. It is stocked with towels (including beach towels) and bed linen, and has a fully equipped kitchen for home cooking.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Renting a car is an absolute must as the gated Treasure Cove community is right at the eastern tip of the island. Downtown Nassau is a 15-20 minute drive away depending on traffic, and taxis can be expensive.<br /><br />About the security deposit: this is payable ONLY if a claim for damages is filed with Airbnb within 14 days of your departure. We have never had to file for damages from a guest so far and don't anticipate ever having to do so :-)<br /><br />About the cancellation policy: Airbnb only allows three options, none of which we liked! So even though we have it set to 'strict', if you cancel at least 30 days before arrival you will receive a 100% refund (though this may not include the Airbnb booking fee). If you cancel at least 7 to 14 days before arrival you will receive a 50% refund.<br /><br />What to pack: bathing suits, sunglasses, suntan lotion, hats, lightweight windbreaker, sweater or shawl if coming in winter, shorts, lightweight shirts, lightweight long pants, socks, comfortable shoes, camera, film, batteries, and all needed medicines, bug spray and itch cream.  <br /><br />Cellphones; If you want to make or receive calls during your stay in the Bahamas, contact your provider BEFORE LEAVING HOME to add an international calling plan that covers your usage in the Bahamas. You can cancel the plan after you leave. Otherwise, if your phone is unlocked, you can purchase a pay-as-you-go (prepaid) sim card at Bahamas Telecommunications Company (BTC) at the Mall at Marathon."
      }
    },
