br />Our thoughtfully designed loft is perfect for unwinding. Whether you want to curl up with a good book or take a peaceful nap, it’s the ultimate spot for tranquility.<br /><br />-KITCHEN<br />The kitchen is fully stocked with everything you need to prepare delicious meals, including complimentary coffee, tea, and an assortment of spices.<br /><br />-BATHROOMS<br />Our luxurious bathrooms feature terrazzo tile floors and stunning fluted tile showers with glass doors. The upstairs bath is especially unique, with high ceilings, elegant curves, and a relaxing wet room complete with a soaking tub—perfect for unwinding after a day of adventure.<br /><br />-OUTDOORS <br />Step outside to our wrap-around deck, featuring a hot tub, cozy seating, a bar with swings, and outdoor games for endless fun. Remember to close and lock the hot tub cover when not in use for safety.<br /><br />On the front porch, two hanging hammocks invite you to kick back, relax, and enjoy the peaceful surroundings.<br /><br />We provide a 240 V Nema 14-50 outlet located at the top of the driveway for those with electric vehicles.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />We have two owner’s closets that are off-limits to guests. Aside from that, feel free to enjoy full access to the entire house—have fun and make yourself at home!<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />-Cabin has very limited cell service, as soon as you log into our WI-FI go into the setting on your phone and change call settings to WI-FI combatable.  This will allow you to make and receive calls using Wi-Fi.  <br /><br />- Bring your own streaming service log in and passwords if you wish to access such apps.  Our Roku TVs are set to log you out of everything upon departure.  <br /><br />-We recommend travel insurance <br /><br />-No smoking of any kind on premises including tobacco<br /><br />-No Pets<br /><br />-We provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, <br />paper towels, garbage bags.  If you’re planning to stay more than a couple of days, we recommend bringing additional supplies.<br /><br />-We have a charcoal grill but we do not provide charcoal.<br /> (BYOC) Bring your own charcoal<br /><br />-Have fun!!!"
