ept the following credit cards: American Express, Visa, Euro/Mastercard, Diners Club, JCB, Maestro, UnionPay debit card, UnionPay credit card. <br />WiFi is available in public areas and is free of charge. <br />Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner are available in AWAKEN restaurant and are ordered prior to arrival."
