he amazing views.  You can be sure to enjoy the tropical holiday you deserve.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Guests will enjoy total privacy during their stay at The Beach House. They have exclusive use of all facilities including beach side pool, lounge, kitchen and surrounding garden area.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />The Beach House is located in a more remote and rural setting way from most busy tourist attractions. It is most suited to travellers looking to relax away from the hustle and bustle of the busier tourist areas of Bali."
