dapt or see first hand some insects that exist in the natural world of Bali, but there is no need to worry because in Bali is a safe place and we do not have insects or poisonous spider. You need to know the spider can make its nest very fast.<br />And the only thing we can do is clean it every time and make sure you will feel free.<br />Each bed in the house are set with mosquito nets and cortain in the window<br /><br />A classic open room with walls made of woven bamboo will make your stay very comfortable and overlooking beautiful natural scenery right from the bedroom.<br /><br />We provide a safety box in the room for your valuable or feel free to leave it with our staff if you would feel it more comfortable.<br /><br /> Breakfast is served in the lobby in front of the room, every morrning.<br /><br />This will make your holiday truly perfect.<br /><br />Here you can take a walk freely to enjoy the true nature of Bali while looking at various types of wild tropical animals such as lizards, ants, chickens, butterflies, dragonflies, gecko  as well.<br />You can hear as many species of birds singing while you are having breakfast.<br /><br />At night you might see little lights flying around you, and yes, they are fireflies.<br /><br />This place will make your holiday very special and comfortable in rural Bali."
