pping, dining, and cultural experiences.<br /><br />This bright, modern apartment provides a stylish base where comfort and aesthetics go hand in hand – the ideal retreat in Copenhagen.<br /><br />No elevator in the building.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />You get the entire property to yourself.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />General Rules:<br /><br />- Smoking is not allowed in the apartment or on the balconies.<br />- Loud music, parties, and disruptive noise are not permitted.<br />- Noise must be kept to a minimum to respect neighbors. Between 10:00 PM and 7:00 AM there must be quiet.<br />- Pets are not allowed unless approved in advance.<br />- Only registered guests are permitted to stay on the property – unregistered visitors must be approved in advance. A maximum of six people is allowed, unless otherwise agreed.<br /><br />The apartment is equipped with smoke and noise detectors that are connected to our management system. If smoking or noise disturbances (such as parties) are detected, the guest may be asked to leave, as this behavior violates our house rules.<br /><br />Safety & Responsibility:<br /><br />- Treat the property and its contents with care – any damages will be charged.<br />- Violation of the house rules may result in additional fees or termination of the stay.<br /><br />Check-in/Check-out:<br /><br />- Please adhere to the agreed check-in and check-out times (see confirmation).<br />- Loss of keys will incur a charge.<br /><br />Cleaning & Waste:<br /><br />- Return the property in the same condition as you received it. All cleaning and laundry (bed linen, etc.) is handled by Le Nord Suites.<br />- Please leave the property tidy and sort waste according to municipal guidelines.<br /><br />Parking & Outdoor Areas:<br /><br />- Follow any local parking regulations.<br />- Use outdoor areas with respect for the property and neighbors.<br /><br /><br />We cannot accept responsibility for lost, stolen, or misplaced belonging