      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Bali’s best kept secret is its secluded West coast where you will find Balian Beach. Nestled between volcanic cliffs, the beautiful black sand beach and crashing waves provide the perfect escape.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />The Beach House offers a spacious master bedroom and open living area only steps away from the beach with views of the main surf break. <br /><br />The Beach House has a fully equipped kitchen, WiFi, and large sun deck all overlooking your own beach-side swimming pool. <br /><br />The nightly rate includes daily maid service, drinking water, and a fully catered breakfast. The breakfast menu consists of fresh farm eggs, homemade sourdough bread, granola, yogurt, and tropical fruit platter. <br /><br />Dinners can be arranged upon request for 300,000 IR per person. Alternatively, you can find a variety of western and Indonesian restaurants a short 5-minute walk down the beach. During the wet season (Dec-Mar) this can require a brief swim, so alternatively we have scooters, available for rent or a car and driver can be arranged, for the short trip to the restaurants.<br /><br />Private in-villa massages and spa treatments can also be arranged during your stay for 200,000 to 250,000 IR.<br /><br />Balian Beach is approximately a 2-3 hour drive from Bali's International Airport.  We highly recommend you let us arrange your airport pick-up/drop-off as we have reliable English-speaking drivers who know the location of the villa.  The cost is 700,000 IDR.<br /><br />We are happy to help you plan day trips to other local attractions and activities in Bali.  These include snorkeling in West Bali's marine park at Menjangan Island, sunset visit to Bali's famous Tanah Lot water temple, mountain drives through UNESCO-listed rice terraces and volcanic lakes or day trips to Ubud and Kuta for the shopaholics.<br /><br />The Beach House is the perfect location to just relax and unwind.  Let our friendly staff spoil you while you take in the amazing views.  You can be sure to enjoy the tropical holiday you deserve.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Guests will enjoy total privacy during their stay at The Beach House. They have exclusive use of all facilities including beach side pool, lounge, kitchen and surrounding garden area.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />The Beach House is located in a more remote and rural setting way from most busy tourist attractions. It is most suited to travellers looking to relax away from the hustle and bustle of the busier tourist areas of Bali."
      }
    },
