      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Recharge your soul from your elevated sanctuary with captivating views of Balian beach. Nestled in a serene surfer's paradise our impeccably designed 2bed 2bath retreat offers tranquility & luxury. Picture-perfect views of the ocean & coconut-clad mountains set the scene for unforgettable moments. With a dedicated manager & staff enjoy seamless relaxation with daily breakfast pristine cleanliness & optional in-house massages. Your perfect Bali escape awaits. We can offer floating breakfast.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Indulge in the essence of paradise at our stunning beachfront oasis in Balian. Perched atop a gentle elevation, soak in the awe-inspiring panoramas of the ocean from every corner of your sanctuary. This impeccably designed 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom retreat offers an unparalleled blend of luxury and tranquility far away from the busy areas of Bali. The villa has new Sony flatscreen TVs and a surround sound music system. Surrounded by the serene ambiance of a quiet surfer's village with a few restaurants and cafes, framed by coconut-draped mountains, it's a picture-perfect haven for couples, friends, and small families seeking to create lifelong memories. Inside, find a harmonious fusion of modern comfort and bespoke designed charm, complete with a well-appointed kitchen, a cozy desk for remote work looking out to the ocean, and a serene massage table for indulgent in-house treatments. With our dedicated manager and staff at your service six days a week, relish in the convenience of daily breakfasts and pristine cleanliness, leaving you free to unwind, recharge, help you book a tour and savor every moment of your idyllic escape.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />The whole villa and pool is private<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Balian is a serene area away from the hustle and bustle of the city. It is a place to relax and unwind. There are some restaurants nearby and they also do delivery to the villa. Please note this is not the city area of Bali, our village is famous for surfing and is still a quiet area of Bali, relax and enjoy the tranquility and sound of the ocean."
