rrounding garden.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />.<br />G r o c e r y:<br />There is a small grocery shop named VOLG in Sörenberg, which is 5km away. It opens seven days a week from 7:00 to 19:00<br /><br />R e s t a u r a n t s <br />(always check the internet for opening hours):<br />- BERGWELTEN SALWIDELI: 10mn walk away. Upscale and elegant setting with a refined menu<br />- RISCHLI: 3km drive away. Upscale and elegant setting with a refined menu<br />- ALPENRÖSLI: 5km drive away. Casual dining, swiss authentic cuisine<br />- BÄCKERSTUBE: 5km drive away. Casual dining, also pizza take-away possible<br />- GASTHOOF 18: 7.5km drive away. Casual dining at the Golf Club Flühli<br /><br />V I S I T S :<br />Interlaken: 1 hour and 30 minutes / 100km<br />Grindelwald: 2 hours / 120km<br />Lauterbrunnen, Mürren: 2 hours / 110km<br />Berne: 1 hour and 20 minutes / 70km<br />Lucerne: 1 hour / 50km"
