      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Escape to our enchanting cottage in the heart of Bora Bora, where turquoise waters meet powdery white sands, creating a picture-perfect backdrop for your tropical escape. Our secluded retreat offers a harmonious blend of luxury and nature, providing a serene oasis for you to unwind and rejuvenate in absolute tranquility.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Imagine your cottage in Bora Bora nestled on the pristine white sands of the beach, surrounded by lush tropical vegetation and overlooking the crystal-clear turquoise waters of the South Pacific Ocean. <br /><br />The cottage is constructed in beach modern style, with balinese furnitures, and open-air design to let in the gentle sea breeze.<br /><br />Your cottage features a spacious bedroom with a large comfortable bed draped in billowing white linens, offering stunning views of the ocean right from your pillow. The living area is elegantly furnished with balinese artisanal furniture and colorful textiles, creating a cozy and inviting atmosphere.<br /><br />Outside, you have a private deck or patio with lounge chairs , perfect for relaxing and soaking in the breathtaking beauty of Bora Bora. A few steps away, you have your own private access to the beach, where you can swim, snorkel, or simply bask in the sun.<br /><br />Overall, your cottage in Bora Bora is a luxurious yet authentic retreat, providing the perfect blend of comfort, tranquility, and natural beauty for a truly unforgettable tropical getaway.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Guests staying at our charming cottage in Bora Bora will have exclusive access to the entire property during their stay. This includes the private cottage itself, the surrounding garden area, and any amenities provided on the premises. <br /><br />When guests arrive at the principal entry door, they will find a secure lockbox or a smart lock system installed. Inside the lockbox, guests will find a set of keys, access code, or a key card needed to unlock the door and gain entry to the property.<br /><br />We want our guests to feel completely at home and enjoy a relaxing and unforgettable stay in this tropical paradise. Should guests have any questions or need assistance during their stay, our friendly staff will be readily available to help make their experience truly memorable.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Upon arrival in Bora Bora by plane, you will experience the breathtaking beauty of the island from the air as they approach the airport. Once you land, you will need to take a short ferry ride from the airport to the main island Vaitape Village.<br /><br />Once in Vaitape village, you can easily find a taxi to take  to the cottage. The taxi ride will provide you with a scenic journey through the lush landscapes and crystal-clear waters that Bora Bora is famous for. You can sit back, relax, and enjoy the stunning views as he makes the way to your accommodation. <br />As far as the rate goes, you can expect to pay anywhere from 2,500 CFP, which equates to roughly $25.00  USD<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />1187DTO-MT"
      }
