        "htmlText": "This dazzling loft with roof top terrace is definitely the place to be, the place to stay for its  privileged location. On the 3rd floor, with no elevator, the presence of  beams in the sitting area add charm but can be inconvenient for very tall persons!<br />A bright open space with air conditioning, dining, sitting, sleeping areas, ensuite dressing room,  full bathroom and  kitchenette. Sleeps 2 guests. <br />Just picture yourself chilling out on the terrace while sipping a delicious local cocktail...<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />The perfect location, in the  heart of Lisbon, makes it unique : a 3 mn walk from trendy Chiado, from arty Bairro Alto districts and from all public transportation, a 10mn walk from lively Baixa district and fashionable Avenidade da Liberdade. The iconic tram 28 is around the corner, jogging along from Chiado hill to Alfama hill (St Jorge castle) to Estrela (Parliament, Basilica, gardens) to Lapa (palaces, museum of Arte Antiga). The train station is down the street, and every 20 mn a train will take you along the Tagus river to Belem (Monastery of Jeronimos, Belem tower) and along the sea side to the beaches (Estoril, Cascais)<br />You will love the brightness and design of this 30m2 open space  with air conditioning, the view on the terrace from the sitting area,  the coziness of the sleeping area with its ensuite dressing room, the full bathroom and  kitchenette. <br />You will thoroughly enjoy chilling out on the terrace  while sipping a delicious local cocktail!<br />You will appreciate the attractive amenities with a very special drink to cheer you up after your trip, a yummy breakfast offered and prepared for the first morning  with a fresh loaf of bread, jam, butter, selection of fruit, juice, coffee, tea and cream (reserves are provided for a couple of days) a cup of Nespresso blend to pep you up after a tiresome day of touring around the city!<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />The loft, with its private entrance door, is all yours!<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />The loft is perfectly located, a five minute walk from Bairro Alto night life and a five minute walk from trendy Chiado! Night life is very animated and Saturday night fever starts on Thursday!<br />It is on the third floor, with no elevator, 30 steps before enjoying the space.<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />71974/AL"
