e a car, you will be able to park inside the gate at additional charge.  Parking must be reserved ahead of time, the price is EUR 35 per day (suitable for a Fiat Punto or similar size).<br /><br />►  The rental price includes: electricity; linens; towels; Internet WI-FI and A/C.<br /><br />► Cleaning team trained in disinfecting and sanitation.<br /><br />We can organize for you:<br /><br />• Amalfi Coast tours<br /><br />• Positano travel guide<br /><br />• Capri island excursions<br /><br />• Amalfi Coast hiking tours<br /><br />• Ravello sightseeing tours<br /><br />• Amalfi Coast culinary tours<br /><br />• Amalfi Coast boat tours<br /><br />• Traditional food with local chef<br /><br />• Amalfi Coast wine tasting tours<br /><br />• Limoncello tasting <br /><br />• Amalfi Coast sunset cruises<br /><br />• Amalfi Coast historical sites<br /><br />• Amalfi Coast adventure activities<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />■ A bus stop is next to the property. But most guests love to walk to the closest towns (Atrani and Amalfi), about 20 minutes walk. <br />■ Parking is available at extra charge.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />A small tourist tax (government fee) have to be paid at the property: EUR 3 per night per person.<br /><br />Late Check in after 10 PM: Eur 40.<br />Parking on request: EUR 35 per day (suitable for a Fiat Punto or similar size).<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />IT065104C28CT2ZBZ2"
