    {
      "id": "DESCRIPTION_DEFAULT",
      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Welcome to Your Kissimmee Getaway!<br /><br />Enjoy a luxurious family-friendly getaway with a private hot tub, heated pool (85°F), PS5 gaming station, arcade games, and themed kids’ bedrooms. Free access to The Hideaway and Bronson Clubs includes a lazy river, water slides, mini-golf, and more. Fully equipped kitchen, free toiletries, towels, and flexible check-in/out ensure a seamless stay. Minutes from Disney, Universal, and shopping, this is the perfect base for your dream vacation<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Luxurious Retreat with Private Hot Tub Near Disney World!<br /><br />Welcome to our beautifully designed vacation home located in the heart of Kissimmee, Florida! Nestled in the exclusive Cove Resort at 2853 Simile Street, this spacious and stylish getaway offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience for families, friends, or business travelers.<br /><br />Highlights of Your Stay:<br />✨ Relax in the private, freestanding hot tub—perfect for unwinding after a day of adventure.<br />✨ Enjoy modern amenities in our fully equipped kitchen, cozy living room, and spacious bedrooms.<br />✨ Three pristine bathrooms, ensuring everyone has plenty of space to refresh.<br />✨ Located just minutes from Disney World, Universal Studios, and Orlando's top attractions.<br />✨ Family-friendly features, including a guidebook with nearby kid-approved activities and dining options.<br /><br />Our home is thoughtfully prepared with high-quality linens, fast Wi-Fi, and smart TVs for your entertainment. We also offer access to resort-style amenities including a sparkling pool, fitness center, and scenic walking paths.<br /><br />What Guests Love:<br />Spacious Comfort: Ideal for large families or groups, our home features ample space to spread out while still feeling cozy. Guests have noted it’s perfect for toddlers to teens.<br /><br />“Our family of 8 had more than enough room to relax. The themed bedrooms were a hit with the kids, and the hot tub was the perfect way to unwind after a long day at Disney!” – Iris, Marion, Ohio<br /><br />Themed Bedrooms: Kids adore our fun themed rooms like Star Wars and Harry Potter, making their stay extra magical.<br /><br />“Kids loved the themed rooms, the arcade games, and the infinity game table. The house was super clean, and the hot tub was awesome!” – Katie, Orlando, FL<br /><br />Entertainment Galore: Enjoy a PS5 gaming station, classic arcade games, an Infinity game table with 100+ board games, and a private hot tub with LED lighting. There’s something for everyone!<br /><br />“Our kids never even touched their iPads! Between the arcade games and pool, there was always something to do.” – Rob, Cleveland, OH<br /><br />Private Pool & Hot Tub: Dive into the pool heated to a cozy 90 degrees year-round or relax in the bubbling hot tub, all while surrounded by a child-safe fence.<br /><br />“Imagine sinking into a warm hot tub surrounded by lush greenery after a day at the parks. This home made it easy to relax and recharge!” – Yael, Hollywood, FL<br /><br />Convenient Location: Just minutes from Disney, Universal Studios, and other Orlando attractions. Publix, Target, and Starbucks are nearby for quick errands.<br /><br />“The location is fantastic – close to Disney and Universal. Publix was nearby for groceries, which made our stay even easier!” – Kimberly, Shinrock, OH<br /><br />Resort Perks: Located in Storey Lake Resort, guests have free access to a tropical swimming pavilion, lazy river, waterslides, fitness center, and more.<br /><br />“The resort amenities were amazing – lazy rivers, pools, and even mini-golf. It felt like we were at a private resort!” – Lindsay, Storey Lake guest<br /><br />Why Families Keep Returning:<br />Super Clean & Comfortable: Guests consistently mention how clean and well-appointed the home is, with comfy beds for restful nights after long days at the parks.<br /><br />“Super clean place (and we’re picky!) with comfortable beds. We’ll definitely stay here again!” – Katie, Orlando, FL<br /><br />Well-Equipped Kitchen: A fully stocked kitchen makes meal prep easy, featuring an air fryer, margarita machine, popcorn maker, and more.<br /><br />Kid-Friendly Features: Baby gates, high chairs, pack-n-play, and childproofing make it hassle-free for families with little ones.<br /><br />“The best childproofed Airbnb we’ve ever stayed at. We felt totally at ease with the kids running around.” – Ciji, Palm Harbor, FL<br /><br />Responsive Host: Our team is praised for being communicative and helpful, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable experience.<br /><br />“Host was very communicative and always available to answer our questions. It made the entire experience stress-free!” – Cheryl, 4 years on Airbnb<br /><br />Your Dream Vacation Awaits<br />Whether you're looking to unwind in the hot tub, explore the nearby attractions, or simply enjoy quality time with your loved ones, our home has everything you need for an unforgettable vacation.<br /><br />“Great place to stay. Very clean, spacious, and close to everything, including shopping centers, stores, and Disney World. We loved it!” – Steve, Fort Belvoir, VA<br /><br />Book now to secure your stay at one of Kissimmee’s most beloved family retreats. Your dream vacation starts here!<br />Whether you're here for a magical Disney vacation, a family reunion, or a relaxing retreat, our home is designed to make your stay truly unforgettable. Book your stay today and start making memories! Please note that we are using a new listing that eliminates extra fees charged by other booking channels.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />During your stay, you’ll have exclusive access to the entire property, including all indoor and outdoor spaces. Here’s what you can enjoy:<br /><br />🏡 Entire Home: Relax and unwind in our fully furnished home, complete with three spacious bathrooms, a modern kitchen, and cozy living areas.<br />🛁 Private Hot Tub: Take advantage of your own freestanding hot tub—perfect for soaking after a fun day exploring.<br />🌟 Resort Amenities: As part of The Cove Resort, you’ll have access to shared community features, including a sparkling pool, lazy river, splash pad, outdoor bar and dining, fitness center, and serene walking paths (specific amenities may vary).<br />🚗 Free Parking: Convenient parking is available for your vehicle right at the property.<br /><br />💼 Complimentary Amenities: We’ve stocked the bathrooms with premium toiletries, so you can pack light and feel pampered.<br />🍫 Welcome Snack Basket: Enjoy a thoughtfully curated snack basket waiting for you upon arrival—a little treat to make your stay even more special.<br /><br />Feel free to make yourself at home! We’ve ensured the property is equipped with everything you need for a comfortable and memorable stay.<br /><br />If you have any questions about the amenities or access, don’t hesitate to reach out—we’re here to help!<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />We’ve gone the extra mile to ensure your stay is as convenient and enjoyable as possible. Here are a few additional highlights:<br /><br />📖 Digital Guidebook: We provide a Touch Stay digital guidebook with all the information you need for your stay, including FAQs, local recommendations, and property details.<br /><br />🔥 Free Pool Heat: Enjoy a consistently warm and inviting pool heated up to 90°F year-round at no extra charge. Please note during cooler months that pool will only heat up to 15 degrees above the current temperature by 4 pm.<br /><br />🍔 Barbecue Access: Fire up the propane gas grill for an unforgettable barbecue experience. Grill tools and propane are provided for free.<br /><br />⏰ Flexible Check-In & Check-Out: We’re happy to offer early check-in or late check-out free of charge when availability allows. Just let us know, and we’ll do our best to accommodate.<br /><br />🎮 Entertainment Galore: From the PS5 gaming station with popular games to free-standing arcade machines and an Infinity game table with over 100 board games, entertainment for all ages is guaranteed.<br /><br />🛁 Complimentary Essentials: We’ve stocked each bathroom with toiletries, including shampoo, conditioner, body wash, and makeup remover wipes. Plenty of bath and pool towels are also provided.<br /><br />👶 Family-Friendly Features: Families will love the themed kids’ bedrooms, baby gates, high chair, and pack ‘n play for younger guests.<br /><br />🛍️ Convenient Add-Ons: For a $25 fee, we can deliver and stock groceries, toiletries, or other essentials before your arrival—perfect for starting your vacation stress-free.<br /><br />🛑 Non-Smoking Property: Smoking is prohibited inside and near the property. A $250 cleaning fee will apply if smoking is discovered.<br /><br />🎉 Exclusive Resort Access: As our guest, you’ll have complimentary access to The Hideaway Club and Bronson Club, including all their incredible amenities, from the lazy river and splash pad to sports courts and private cabanas.<br /><br />We’ve thought of everything to make your Kissimmee getaway unforgettable. If you have any questions or special requests, don’t hesitate to reach out!<br /><br />A one time $35 Security & Protection Fee is included in your reservation total.  This fee covers guest identity verification and provides up to $50,000 in accidental damage protection during your stay."
