        "htmlText": "Private Suite featuring a 28-sqm bedroom with its own bathroom (shower) en suite, within a two-storey trendy loft with rooftop terrace, ideally located close to MQ (Museumsquartier) in Vienna's Bo-Bo 7th district.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />You get your private \"apartment-like\" bedroom (28 m2 with PARTIALLY ROOF-SLOPED ceiling) within a double-storey rooftop loft-type flat (215 m2). Your L-shaped “apartment”, away from any street noise and thoroughly quiet, features three successive areas (a bedroom with a futon mattress bed, a study with writing desk, and a reading/sitting area) as well as your OWN EN-SUITE SHOWER-ROOM (with towels, hairdryer, cleansing tissues, …, as well as your own washing machine and dryer for your laundry). We provide cotton linen on the bed and fresh plush cotton towels (bath size, personal size).<br />N.B. The suite is set in a rooftop area featuring a partially sloped ceiling which MIGHT NOT BE SUITABLE FOR TALL GUESTS. <br /><br />When you walk in, by your bed will be your keys, your WIFI access code and a map to the city. A tray with tea & coffee-making facilities for your own use will be ready as well on the desk.<br /><br />We live in another large bedroom on the other side of the loft-space and have our own bathroom, meaning that both guests’ and hosts’ privacy are fully secured.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />Rooftop terrace (10m2, East oriented, i.e. morning sun) in SHARED SPACE WITH US.<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />We speak English, French, German, Spanish, Italian and Portuguese."
