      "htmlDescription": {
        "htmlText": "Want a Unique Getaway!!<br />with a Hot Tub/Fireplace, and Espresso Machine!<br /><br />Where to start?<br />From the architecture to the luxury furnishings, <br />to the woods surrounding it, to the hot tub, <br />to the Gas burning fireplace to sit beside your loved ones while drinking your latte that you can make by using the espresso machine, <br /><br />An oasis!<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Located on a 132 acre estate, This serene romantic place is perfect for a couples getaway or an intimate family trip or for a girls trip! )<br /><br />When you come down the winding driveway off of the mountain you ll see a clearing and then your eyes land on this stunning stone cottage (and the beautiful pool in the summer)and it feels like your in Italy! <br /><br />Outside⬇️<br />The amazing pool & outdoor living if your booking from Memorial day thru Labor Day!! (It is not heated. )<br /><br />It has a large hot tub year round and at night it’s absolutely magical to sit in it and watch all the lights turn on in the valley below! Lots of string lights and Super romantic and lots of ambiance lighting to help you unwind and relax! <br /><br />We also have a firepit beside the pool with chairs around it and it has a cooking rack. Perfect for those s’mores and maybe even some burgers or steaks! <br /><br />A porch swing perfect to relax on and read a book. <br /><br />It has a mile long scenic paved walking trail down towards the river and also some wooded hiking trails that will be an amazing experience for you! A Very private and a serene oasis that makes you never want to leave and has lots of wildlife and charm! <br /><br />We do have e-bike and golf cart rentals! Please message us to reserve them! There is a long paved biking trail Called the Enola low grade trail that travels along the river for miles. <br /><br />golf cart is $95 per day<br />E-bikes are $50 per day per bike<br /><br />The pond is at the end of the half mile driveway and is an option for you to enjoy a picnic or relaxing on the hammock. Please note It is shared with two other houses. <br /><br />There are paddle boards and it is a stocked pond! Bring your rods! <br /><br />⬇️Inside you ll find an interior designer’s dream! <br />So much thought was put into every detail of this project. <br />From the massive stone fireplace in the comfy living room with a queen sleeper sofa and a frame tv & board games<br /> to the unique floors and unique Romantic master bedroom with a King bed and  luxury linens, cozy blankets to cuddle up in and robes to enjoy. <br />Plus it has a Cozy loft up top with a king bed as well to lounge in: if your an adult, channel your inner child because it feels like a fort when your up there! Perfect spot to curl up and read! And if you bring children, they will love it! There also a queen memory foam sleeper sofa in living room if you want to bring a few friends or want to have a girls wknd or birthday celebrations ! <br /><br />(Please note ,It does not have a  door separating the loft from the bedroom)  <br /><br />The bathroom is a tiled walk-in shower and has the open concept with a pedestal sink and soft towels and has soap & shampoo &conditioner! <br /><br />The kitchenette is lovely and has a large island perfect for an intimate brunch date , we have a waffle maker so be sure to bring the things you need to enjoy making these together, <br /> It also has a breville espresso machine that shows step by step instructions on how to make your fave lattes/cappuccino/ to enjoy! We have a few syrups & maple syrup and sugar there but bring your own dairy products and favorite syrups to use. <br /><br />The kitchenette does have two mini fridges and a small freezer and a microwave but no oven. It does have a waffle maker, a large electric skillet, a toaster, blender, drip coffee maker,and coffee and a canister of espresso beans for you to use and we have a grill outside the door that also has a side burner! <br /><br />This property is located 3 minutes from historic town of Wrightsville where you ll find waterfront dining at the historic John wright restaurant and  Thrift stores, wineries, and the wild batch bistro cafe also the Susquehanna riverfront with a boat and kayak launch. <br /><br />If you are traveling and need a little luxury pit stop we are located 3 min from the 30 bypass! <br /><br />15 minutes from amazing shopping malls and25 min to Lancaster and the heart of the Amish community where you ll find amazing scenery of pristine farms and gardens and so many animals! Horse & buggies and home cooked food and smorgasbords and also the sight and sound bible theatre. We d love to help you curate a fun day trip & we grew up amish so we ll share all the best spots for trying Amish cooking and the horse & buggy tours thru scenic farmland. You can also see my guidebook and see other fun options! <br /><br />We re excited to host you and have you experience this beautiful place! Happy relaxing!<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />Please note that this pool house can be rented with the mansion but also as a separate stay, the pool house sits at the bottom of the rocky  Roundtop Mountain and the mansion is up on top of the rocky cliffs. <br />So they do have complete privacy from each other. <br /><br />The kitchen is a kitchenette! No cook top or baker! An electric skillet and waffle maker & microwave as well as a grill with a side burner is there for you to prep food on.<br /><br />This listing is for your guest number only, sleeps up to 6 guests if the pullout sofa is used.<br />You will be asked to confirm total guest number.<br /><br />Please do not instant book this property without communicating with the host if you plan on having more than 6 guests on the property at anytime!<br /><br />We typically do not allow extra guests in and out, unless permitted by host. In which, extra charges may be added.<br /><br />In order to accommodate both couples and small groups, we do charge extra for more than 2 guests.<br /><br /><br />You are staying in the woods and along with the privacy that offers you may encounter bugs, especially during season changes.<br />Please be aware that some might come inside regardless of any effort on our part."
