        "htmlText": "We invite you to experience this Charming Cabin!!!  The perfect spot to celebrate anniversaries,  birthdays or any special occasion!                                                                                  <br /> A Romantic couples getaway with a Cozy Fireplace, Hot Tub, and endless Lattes with our Breville touch Espresso machine!<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />A serene private spot built directly beside the pond with a fountain and waterfall,<br /><br /> It has a hot tub, a firepit with a string lights and all the Romantic indoor and outdoor ambiance to enjoy a lovely couples getaway!            <br /><br /> It has a hiking trail that comes right to the back door that is a short walk to a 1 mile paved trail that follows the mountain top and multiple other hiking trails on the property, it is very secluded and tucked in a wooded area on our 132 Acre Estate. <br /><br />The Chalet has the perfect romantic atmosphere for a couples birthday trip /anniversary celebration /honeymoon. <br /><br />Sitting on the deck in the hot tub or on the screen porch while listening to the waterfall will immediately put your mind at ease and help you unwind with your love by your side: a perfect place to fall deeper in love and connect. Grill up a steak while watching wild life beside the pond. <br /><br />The living room has a Gas burning fireplace and a delightfully comfy reclining sofa, a breakfast nook and a fabulous view of the pond just outside the sliding doors! <br />Come and cozy up with your favorite person!<br /><br />The stunning kitchen is a perfect spot to make yummy waffles (yes we have a waffle maker! )or a shot of espresso or lattes and we also have a drip coffee maker if that’s your preference! A cozy breakfast nook is a great place to sit to eat with a view of the pond and woods, you might see deer! <br /><br />The living room has a comfy reclining couch!<br />It has a large tv with streaming options for that movie night and soft blankets to cuddle with/ it also has a Gas burning indoor fireplace! <br /><br />The loft has a king bed with luxurious linens,cozy blankets and a ROMANTIC ambiance with a chandelier and then has a powder room as well, <br />Then you ll find the main bathroom with the shower on the first floor, it is a luxury tile shower with floor to ceiling tile and has cozy robes to slip on and soft white towels,shower gel,shampoo & conditioner for you to use. <br /><br />(Please note, <br />if you are not agile you might have a challenge with loft steps, they are fairly steep but very accessible.)<br /><br />TO DO<br /><br />We do have a golf cart rental and a ebike rental, message us to learn more about that! There’s a long paved trail close by along the river called the Enola low grade trail. Perfect for e-bike adventures! <br /><br />Golf Cart is $95 per day<br />E-bikes are $50 per day per bike<br /><br /> We have a second pond that’s stocked at the end of the half mile long driveway with paddle boards and a small boat that is shared with the other 2 rentals on the estate, you are welcome to go cast a line, use the paddle boards or relax on the hammock after a picnic lunch. <br /><br />This property is located a few minutes from historic town of Wrightsville with antique malls  close by and the famous John wright waterfront restaurant , the Susquehanna river front & kayak and boat launches and scenic overlooks/hiking trails.<br /><br />Only 3 min off the route 30 bypass so if you are traveling a need a pit stop, here you go! <br /><br />15 minutes from amazing shopping malls and 25 min to Lancaster and the heart of the Amish community where you ll find amazing scenery of pristine farms and gardens and so many animals! Horse & buggies and home cooked food and smorgasbords and also the sight and sound bible theatre. Please see the guidebook in our profile  for our favorite dining and fun spots where you can find horse and buggy rides and the best Whoopie pies and our fave food close by and amazing hiking overlook spots!<br /><br />If u want to bring a pet please inquire since we do charge additional for pets!<br /><br />We d love to host you and please let us know if you are celebrating anything special! <br />Come be our guests!<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />The kitchen does not have an oven. <br /><br />However we made sure you have plenty of amenities to cook delicious meals with a waffle maker, a large electric skillet, a toaster, a microwave, and a gas grill with a side burner on the deck.<br /><br />We do provide wood for firepit.<br /><br /><br />You are staying in the woods, and along with the privacy this offers you may encounter bugs, especially during season changes.<br />Please be aware that some might come inside regardless of any effort on our part."
