        "htmlText": "Kick back and relax in this calm, quiet, stylish space. Modern deco abounds this elegant residence located lakefront facing due west for the most amazing sunsets you will see anywhere in the state. Close to 5 beautiful waterfalls 3 Distilleries, Bonnaroo music festival, The Caverns , and many more outdoor water and lake activities this Home will not disappoint!<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />A Fully furnished kitchen and upscale bathrooms make this special place feel like home. Spacious bedrooms with closets and luggage racks for your storage. All bedrooms have night stands and also lights for reading.  Lake access to boat ramp and swimming/ fishing area close by. Close to bonnaroo, local distilleries and hike to many waterfalls in the area.<br /><br /><b>Guest access</b><br />The entire house and property is available and all private. Nothing is shared<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />There are a couple of small stairs to access the main entrance door and the porch. No handicap accessible ramp.<br /><br />Being in a heavily wooded area, leaves are blown off of the deck and driveway at least once a week every week, but some may be present at your arrival or during your stay. There is a blower on site for your convenience if needed.<br /><br />Lines and toiletries included  are as follows:<br />Bathrooms:<br />1 bath towel per guest (min)<br />1 wash cloth per guest (min)<br />1 hand towel per bathroom <br />4 spa towels (min) <br />One full of toilet paper per bathroom , plus one extra roll total<br />Hand soap <br />One hairdryer (in master bath) <br /><br />Kitchen: <br />One full roll of paper towels <br />Dish soap <br />Dishwasher detergent <br />One dish towel (min) <br />Hand soap <br /><br />2 Coffee makers are on site, Keurig and Conventional Drip type. <br />BYOC (bring your own coffee) etc. <br />Coffee filters and coffee MAY be present, but are NOT guaranteed. <br /><br />Fireplace: <br />Outdoor  Fire pit is wood burning<br />There may be Wood present and you are welcome to use if so, but it is NOT guaranteed. So I encourage you to bring your own if you desire  to use the wood burning fire pit. There WILL be starter lighter on-site. <br />.  (I’ve had people burning a full seasons  worth of my stacked wood in one weekend, so what’s available is on a limited basis now)<br /><br />Propane: <br />There  WILL  be propane onsite for the gas grill. <br />There will also be an extra FULL  tank in the garage in case you were to run out. <br />Check in time is 4pm CST"
