        "htmlText": "Welcome to The Bacchus! <br /><br />SLEEPS:<br />Bedroom 1 …..King Bed<br />Bedroom 2 …..King Bed<br />Living Room …..Queen Sleeper Sofa<br /><br />This location is:<br />- 10 minute walk to French Quarter<br />- 4 blocks from St. Charles Streetcar line<br />- 2 blocks to the Convention Center<br />- 1 mile from Superdome and Smoothie King Center<br /><br />PARKING<br />While we do not have any parking on-site, there are many parking options nearby. Thankfully we are optimal for walking or short rideshare experiences for guests of all ages.<br /><br /><b>The space</b><br />Let Les Bons Temps Fouler!\r<br />\r<br />Welcome to The Bacchus!  It’s time to gather your KREWE for this elevated experience in The Big Easy! Each of NOLA LUX’s condos are designed with YOU in mind - high-end furnishings & decor, stocked with ALL of the essentials to get you started, and resonates VACATION MODE.\r<br />\r<br />Private corner, wrap around balcony - over 650SQFT! Need we say more?? The Bacchus is the perfect place to relax after a day in The Big Easy. Modern finishes and decor make this the ideal home away from home. Two ensuites are an added bonus we would say! Look not further for a highly coveted home in New Orleans’ Warehouse District!\r<br />\r<br />Each spot is equipped with a starter kit, so you have the basics you need to kick start your vacation as soon as you get here. Kitchenware. Coffee. Toiletries. The essentials. We also leave you a little lagniappe snack/drinks while while you get settled in.\r<br />\r<br />Besides all the goodies we already bring to the table, this location is:\r<br />- Ten minute walk to French Quarter\r<br />- Four blocks from St. Charles Streetcar line\r<br />- Two blocks to the Convention Center\r<br />- One mile from Superdome and Smoothie King Center\r<br />- Walking distance to countless other attractions for all ages\r<br />\r<br />THINGS YOU SHOULD KNOW\r<br />- We are LOCAL! Property is designed and operated by NOLA Luxury Rentals\r<br />- Lowest rates are always available direct.\r<br />- Discounts may not be available via third party booking sites.\r<br />\r<br />Why Us?\r<br />If you could take the perks of a boutique hotel and the home of your dreams – that would be us! As a small, local, family run company we are passionate about providing exceptional service to each and every guest. We like to let our reviews speak for themselves. (:\r<br />\r<br />Stay Fresh\r<br />This property will be professionally cleaned and sanitized before your arrival and prepped to perfection with two pillows and plush towels for every head. Cancel your morning plans because you’ll never want to get out of bed!\r<br />\r<br />Stay Current\r<br />The Bacchus is unlike any other home in New Orleans. The high end, custom design was created with you in mind.\r<br />\r<br />Stay Busy🐝\r<br />Take your morning coffee, daily activities, evening wind downs, nightlife….or just RELAX here. Nothing is too far from this spot in the highly desirable Warehouse District. \r<br />\r<br />SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS\r<br />\r<br />Bedroom 1 ………..King Bed\r<br />Bedroom 2 ………..King Bed\r<br />Living .....................Queen Sleeper Sofa\r<br />\r<br />IMPRESSIVE FEATURES\r<br />- Historical and original elements preserved in this home including cypress beams and exposed bricks\r<br />- Expansive living area with plenty of seating\r<br />- Full Kitchen with gas range & Keurig\r<br />- Aesthetically pleasing decor and comfortable furniture\r<br />- Prime Location in Warehouse District\r<br />- Common Area Security Cameras\r<br />- Supply Starter Kit\r<br />\r<br />LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION\r<br />The Bacchus has a location that can’t be beat! Get your steps in and check out the coolest local bars and restaurants that NOLA has to offer all within a casual stroll of this home. Did we mention the French Quarter was just a 10 minute walk? If you want even more excitement, grab an Uber to Magazine Street, Marigny, or Bywater.\r<br />Four blocks from the St. Charles Streetcar Line.. this is a great option to see the gorgeous mansions and Live Oak tree draping of St. Charles Avenue. \r<br />Countless coffee shops and convenience stores located in a two block radius of this home. \r<br />Rouses Market is nearby too. \r<br />\r<br />EVERY HOME, EVERY TIME\r<br />In a NOLA LUX home, you’ll always find our bathrooms stocked with a starter set of everything you need to get squeaky clean including (but not only) shampoo, conditioner, and body wash. Our kitchens have all the essentials needed to prepare your favorite meal. Kick start each morning with Keurig coffee pods included with every stay. We’ve even got your TV entertainment covered with hundreds of streaming options to choose from.\r<br />NOLA LUX homes are immaculate and well maintained by professionals who clean and sanitize between every guest using the highest standards in the industry.\r<br />\r<br />GENERAL INFORMATION\r<br />The following details are important but aren’t specific to this particular unit and apply to all reservations made at a NOLA LUX property.\r<br />\r<br />WE RECOMMEND TRIP INSURANCE\r<br />Planning a vacation can be stressful enough when everything goes right but adding a pandemic to the mix adds a whole lot of uncertainty. Trip insurance keeps you from losing your vacation rental investment if you need to cancel for a covered reason. We’re here to help if you have any questions!\r<br />\r<br />HOUSE RULES\r<br />These are all no brainers, but we don’t want any confusion so we’re going to state the obvious:\r<br />- NO SMOKING\r<br />- No gatherings greater than the approved occupants\r<br />- No rearranging furniture please\r<br />- Quiet hours between 10PM - 8AM strictly enforced\r<br />\r<br />MINIMUM AGE REQUIREMENTS\r<br />The primary renter must be at least 21 years old. There are exceptions made on a case-by-case basis and with a paid security deposit and our express written permission. Contact us for details.\r<br />\r<br />**We do not accept bookings from guests within a 50 mile radius.**\r<br />\r<br />SECURITY CAMERAS\r<br />Security cameras are in all common spaces of the building, but no worries, no cameras inside any of the homes. We do also have internal sensors that detect temperature, humidity, THC, vapor, and decibel levels.\r<br />\r<br />GUEST REGISTRATION\r<br />After you book your reservation, we will require the completion of our electronic Rental Agreement and a copy of a government-issued ID (excluding Airbnb bookings).Once completed, your check-in instructions will be emailed to you thirty days before your arrival date.\r<br />\r<br />OPTIONAL FEES\r<br />The following fees are paid in addition to and after the reservation is paid for:\r<br />- $75 Early Check-In anytime after 11AM (must be arranged within three days of arrival)\r<br />- $75 Late Check-Out anytime before 2PM (must be arranged within three days of arrival)\r<br />- $25 per night single rollaway bed rental (includes all necessary bedding)\r<br />- $25 per night crib rental (includes all necessary bedding)\r<br />\r<br />SUPPLY STARTER KIT\r<br />No one wants to have to worry about getting to the store after traveling all day! That’s why we provide a supply starter kit – to get you through the first day or two of your stay.\r<br />The kit includes: three rolls of paper towels, dish sponge, five dishwasher pods, four trash bags, dishwashing liquid, ~12 coffee pods per bedroom count, creamer, sweetener, salt/pepper, olive oil, hand soap, shampoo, conditioner, body wash, bath soap bar, lotion, mouthwash, toothbrushes, toothpaste, and three rolls of toilet paper in each bathroom.\r<br />*bathroom setups included in powder baths*\r<br />\r<br />PARKING\r<br />While we do not have any long-term parking on-site, there are countless parking options that we would be happy to provide more information on. Thankfully our location is optimal for walking (or short Uber/Lyft ride) experiences for guests of all ages.\r<br />\r<br />OUR PROMISE\r<br />At NOLA LUX, we’re a dedicated and small (yet mighty) team on a mission to bring more passion and joy into the world through shared experiences. And great news for you, we both have the same goal: for your stay to be nothing short of perfect. With that said, sometimes the unexpected happens. Our homes are houses, no different than yours. If anything comes up, we promise to spring into action and do everything we can to resolve it. We strive for NOTHING LESS THAN FIVE STAR SERVICE.\r<br />\r<br />If you have any issues or are unhappy with your stay, be sure to call, text, or email us so we may rectify the situation.\r<br />\r<br />We look forward to you booking our home and hosting your stay!!\r<br />\r<br />Stay Luxe,\r<br />New Orleans Luxury Rentals<br /><br /><b>Other things to note</b><br />There is a designated garbage disposal room with a chute if you follow down the hallway towards the elevator. It will be on the right-hand side, about halfway down, and it is labeled as well.<br /><br /><b>Registration number</b><br />22-CSTR-20050, 24-OSTR-18219"
